OL,3,GNEWSA'I've got to learn how to be half
OL,4,Aa whole'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelia Smith said she needs to learn how
OL,7,Fto be "half a whole" after the death of
OL,8,Fher husband.
OL,10,FMichael Wynn Jones and Smith were
OL,11,Fmarried for 55 years before he died in
OL,12,FSeptember. They were majority
OL,13,Fshareholders at Norwich City Football
OL,14,FClub for 26 years before handing over
OL,15,Fcontrol of the club in 2024.
OL,17,FSmith said she was by his side "night
OL,18,Fand day" during the last six weeks of
OL,19,Fhis life, when speaking on the Amol
OL,20,FRajan Connections podcast.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
