OL,3,GNEWSA'I've got to learn how to be half
OL,4,Aa whole'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm filled with gratitude; I mean, 55
OL,7,Fyears of a marriage that was so
OL,8,Fincredible, I mean, we had such a ball
OL,9,Ftogether," she added.
